      69.84,
      397.68,
      561.93,
      515.75
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under section 2(2) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance, No. 12 of 1946, read with Section2 of the Provincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, I Isura Dewapriya, the Chief Minister of WesternProvince and Minister of Finance and Planning, Engineering Services, Law and Order, Local Government and ProvincialAdministration, Economic Promotion, Electricity and Power, Environment Affairs, Water Supply and Drainage and TourismAffairs of Western Province do by this order declare that I have approved to impose and charge, a 20% Entertainment Tax onentrance fee for entertainment activities stated in the Entertainment Tax Ordinance, No. 12 of 1946 amended by EntertainmentTax (Amendment) Act, No. 37 of 1984, however only 7.5% to be charged for the entrance fee for films screened in Cinema hallswithin the limits of the Urban Council, the proposition No. 2583 of which has been made by the secretary of Urban CouncilKalutara on 02nd November 2017 as per provisions stated in section 2 (1) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946to be read with Section 184 (A) of Urban Council Ordinance.",
